### POLICYFLOW API Collection & Test Scenarios
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api

### 1. Intake New Policy Request (201 Created)
# @name createPolicy
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-2026-0001",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Sample Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1998-04-10",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-10",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-14",
  "plan_code": "PLUS",
  "sum_insured": 300000
}

### 2. Idempotent Duplicate Intake (200 OK - Returns Existing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-2026-0001",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Sample Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1998-04-10",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-10",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-14",
  "plan_code": "PLUS",
  "sum_insured": 300000
}

### 3. Validation Error: Invalid Dates (422 Unprocessable Content)
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-INVALID-DATE",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Invalid Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1998-04-10",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-14",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-10",
  "plan_code": "PLUS",
  "sum_insured": 300000
}

### 4. Validation Error: Unsupported Plan (422 Unprocessable Content)
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-INVALID-PLAN",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Invalid Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1998-04-10",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-10",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-14",
  "plan_code": "ULTRA_TIER",
  "sum_insured": 300000
}

### 5. Get Policy Details & Audit Trail (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. List Policies with Status Filter (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests?status=VALIDATED&per_page=10
Accept: application/json

### 7. Submit Policy - SUCCESS Scenario (200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "scenario": "SUCCESS"
}

### 8. Submit Policy - TIMEOUT_AFTER_ISSUE Scenario (200 OK -> NEEDS_RECONCILIATION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests/2/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "scenario": "TIMEOUT_AFTER_ISSUE"
}

### 9. Reconcile Policy after Timeout (200 OK -> ISSUED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests/2/reconcile
Accept: application/json

### 10. Submit Policy - DELAYED_CALLBACK Scenario (202 Accepted -> PENDING_CONFIRMATION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests/4/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "scenario": "DELAYED_CALLBACK"
}

### 11. Mock Insurer Webhook Callback (Idempotent 200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mock-insurer/callback
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "event_id": "EVT-MANUAL-1001",
  "provider_reference": "PRV-DEMO-0001",
  "event_type": "POLICY_ISSUED",
  "policy_number": "POL-CALLBACK-2026-0001"
}

### 12. Mock Insurer Status Lookup
GET {{baseUrl}}/mock-insurer/status/PRV-DEMO-0001
Accept: application/json

### 13. Bulk CSV Intake
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests/bulk-csv
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "csv_content": "client_request_id,agent_id,customer_name,date_of_birth,destination,trip_start,trip_end,plan_code,sum_insured\nBULK-REQ-101,AGENT-99,Rohan Verma,1993-08-20,DOMESTIC,2026-12-01,2026-12-05,BASIC,100000\nBULK-REQ-102,AGENT-99,Kavita Rao,1980-04-15,INTERNATIONAL,2026-12-01,2026-12-10,PLUS,300000"
}
